        <mxCell id="HgFvYmWhbVp14aFyp_Vc-185" value="Suspendisse mauris urna, hendrerit a urna imperdiet, egestas dapibus nibh. Aenean interdum magna quis lobortis pretium. Sed mattis sit amet tellus non dignissim. Nam eros nunc, scelerisque et sagittis in, faucibus in nulla.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Suspendisse potenti. Donec nunc elit, fermentum sed eros quis, egestas lobortis ante. Pellentesque non malesuada nisl, et ultricies elit." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="HgFvYmWhbVp14aFyp_Vc-135">
